  "interpretation": "Antithetic pairing supplies the dominant variance reduction. Top-two spectral strata do not meet the 20 percent gain against both pairing and matched random strata in any of the 32 condition averages. Local response improves candidate reconstruction substantially, but better denoising does not automatically reduce finite-query continuation guidance MSE. Geometry rank four lowers mixture continuation-reference bias relative to the isotropic control, while that control has lower total finite-M32 error on both toy models. Continue bounded real-critic and image mechanism verification as predeclared; no endpoint claim."
